flowchart TD
    A[Candidate country, city and first vertical] --> B[Define Ubi legal entity and exact release]
    B --> C[Map people, contracts, money, data, messages, calls and providers]
    C --> D[Local privacy, consumer, electronic transaction, payment, tax, telecom, cyber and sector review]
    D --> E{Registrations, providers, controls, documents and operations feasible?}
    E -->|No| F[Change scope, entity/provider or reject launch country]
    E -->|Yes| G[Implement controls, notices, terms, rights, incident and record processes]
    G --> H[Local-language usability and operational rehearsal]
    H --> I{Counsel and accountable owners approve evidence?}
    I -->|No| F
    I -->|Yes| J[Country-specific release authorization]
    J --> K[Monitor law/provider changes; repeat gate for expansion]
